# google-services.json IS committed — it's the Firebase project identifier
# that ships inside every APK anyway, so keeping it in the repo is standard
# practice and required for cloud (EAS) builds. It is NOT a service-account
# key. The real Firebase secret (Admin SDK JSON) lives only on the worker.
